  "id": "mexican-style-guacamole",
  "name": "Mexican-Style Guacamole",
  "subtitle": "Fresh avocado dip with tomato, lime-free citrus, herbs, and jalapeño",
  "description": "A simple chunky avocado dip with fresh vegetables, cilantro, citrus, and mild heat.",
